OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 26 DEC
OL,4,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert: Gershwin &
OL,5,     FMiss Swift
OL,6,     GThe team behind Benny & Hitch
OL,7,     Greturn with another fascinating
OL,8,     Gtrue story. This one takes us to
OL,9,     GNew York and the extraordinary
OL,10,     Gaffair between composer Kay Swift
OL,11,     Gand George Gershwin.
OL,12,G2200FLate Junction
OL,13,     GVerity Sharp offers up some sonic
OL,14,     Ghighlights from a year of
OL,15,     Gadventurous listening, with help
OL,16,     Gfrom Late Junction family and
OL,17,     Gfriends.
OL,18,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,19,     GThis week Soweto shares more of
OL,20,     Gthe best in jazz and festive
OL,21,     Gfavourites.
